      "amount": "1 teaspoon"
    },
    {
      "name": "Ghee or oil",
      "amount": "2 tablespoons"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Heat ghee or oil in a large pan over medium heat.",
    "Add cumin seeds and let them sizzle for a few seconds.",
    "Add chopped onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for another minute.",
    "Add shredded white cabbage and cook until it is slightly wilted.",
    "Add coriander powder, turmeric, and salt, and stir well.",
    "Add basmati rice and stir to combine with the cabbage mixture.",
    "Add 4 cups of water to the pan and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low, cover the pan, and simmer for 15-20 minutes or until the rice is cooked and the water is absorbed."
